      "content": "counselors just tell you that 'it gets better' but it won't. how is it supposed to get better when the one thing that made life worth living is gone? i feel like a ghost walking around in a body that doesn't even belong to me anymore. it's just a broken machine now. what's the point of maintaining a machine that's useless?",
